cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: DAMICORE
abstract: >-
  DAMICORE clusters the rows or columns of a local CSV without asking for a
  feature representation or a number of clusters. It serializes each object
  canonically, measures every pair with exact Normalized Compression Distance,
  builds a deterministic Neighbor Joining tree, and cuts communities out of that
  tree with FastGreedy.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
